~ start
Archivist: Welcome. I am the Archivist of this castle. [#portrait=res://scenes/ui/cutscenes/images/archivist_normal.png]
Archivist: I do not need sight to read a prophecy. But the magic must speak clearly. And I have a problem with this prophecy. [#portrait=res://scenes/ui/cutscenes/images/archivist_sad.png]
Archivist: My magical screen reader cannot make sense of this orb. It just says: "Visual Prophecy underscore Final Magic". [#portrait=res://scenes/ui/cutscenes/images/crystall_ball.png]
: You activate your power to see as she does. [#activate_shader] [#portrait=res://scenes/ui/cutscenes/images/crystall_ball_prophecy.png]
: The world fades to dark. The magical Archivist is blind! [#show_debug] [#minigame_menu] 
: Read about this in the Manual.
Archivist: I fear this is important... 
=> END

~ fail_reaction
Archivist: No... the screen reader is still reading nonsense. I cannot see the prophecy.
=> END

~ win_reaction
Archivist: "A dragon flying over a burning castle"... I see it perfectly now! [#deactivate_shader] 
Archivist: It is Kalipso!!! The great dragon is returning! You must hurry! [#close_minigame] [#portrait=res://scenes/ui/cutscenes/images/prophecy_expanded.png]
Archivist: You have to reach the Herald immediately, the reign must know! We need a hero to save us from the dragon!
Archivist: She usually wanders around the castle, go look for her!
=> END

~ already_helped
Archivist: Hurry up! You have to find the Herald! She should be somewhere in the castle!
=> END